{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2023-03-01 13:00:00', 'title': 'THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY CEO BOB IGER TO PARTICIPATE IN THE MORGAN STANLEY TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND TELECOM CONFERENCE', 'text': 'BURBANK, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BOB IGER, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY (NYSE: DIS), WILL PARTICIPATE IN A QUESTION-AND-ANSWER SESSION AT THE MORGAN STANLEY TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND TELECOM CONFERENCE ON THURSDAY, MARCH 9, 2023 AT APPROXIMATELY 12:45 P.M. ET/ 9:45 A.M. PT. TO STREAM LIVE, PLEASE VISIT WWW.DISNEY.COM/INVESTORS. A RECORDING OF THE QUESTION-AND-ANSWER SESSION WILL BE ARCHIVED ON OUR WEBSITE.'}